{"sourceUrl":"http://sen.whut.edu.cn/tzgg/202509/t20250915_1349017.shtml","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:14.032653+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://sen.whut.edu.cn/tzgg/202509/t20250915_1349017.shtml","html":"<div>\n<div>\n<h2>【研究生招生】武汉理工大学创业学院2026年推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生招生简章</h2>\n<p>发布时间：2025-09-14  </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><p><br/></p><p><span><strong>一</strong></span><span><strong>、</strong></span><span><strong>申请条件</strong></span></p><p><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span>、政治素养良好，遵纪守法，有社会责任感，身心健康</span><span>。</span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span>、获得本科所在学校的推荐免试生资格，并在教育部“推免服务系统”报名成功者</span><span>。</span></p><p><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span>、</span><span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span>年入学前获得本科毕业证书和学位证书</span><span>。</span></p><p><span><strong>二、招生类别和招生人数</strong></span></p><p><span>全日制学术型硕士研究生</span></p><center><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span>序号</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>专业名称</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>专业代码</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>学习形式</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>拟招生人数</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>1</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>创业管理</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>1202</span></span></span><span><span><span>Z1</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>7</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></center><p><span><strong>三、申请、复试工作安排</strong></span></p><p><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span>、招收推免生本科毕业专业</span><span>不限。</span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span>、考核内容：管理学与经济学基础理论，创业管理相关专业知识，创业实践能力与综合素质。</span></p><p><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span>、复试工作安排说明</span><span>：采用到校面试的方式进行。时间为</span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span>月</span><span><span><span>19</span></span><span><span></span></span></span><span>日</span><span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span>月</span><span><span><span>21</span></span></span><span>日</span><span>，具体面试时间和面试方式另行通知。</span></p><p><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span>、推免预报名：申请人于</span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span>年</span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span>月</span><span><span><span>16</span></span></span><span>日</span><span><span><span>23</span></span><span><span>:00</span></span></span><span>前，申请武汉理工大学创业学院</span><span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span>26</span></span></span><span>年度推免硕士生（包括本校和外校），在“武汉理工大学研究生招生服务系统”（以下简称“推免预报名系统”）完成推免预报名，报名时须将相关材料汇总成一份电子版文件（</span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span><span>）上传至“推免预报名系统”相应项中。</span></p><p><span>（预报名网址：</span><span><span>http://whlg.form.360eol.com/enroll/325YYUo3</span></span><span>）</span></p><p><span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>.</span></span></span><span>通过本系统预报名并取得推免生资格的学生，待教育部开通推免生报名系统后</span><span>，仍须在教育部的推免系统中完成填报志愿等相关操作，否则申请无效。</span></p><p><span>参加我院预接收推免生考核并取得预录取通知的推免生，在教育部“推免服务系统”开放后</span><span><span>8</span></span><span>小时内填报志愿，可免去复试环节，直接接收并确认我院的复试及待录取通知。</span></p><p><span><span>未参加我校预报名的推免生，可在教育部全国推免服务系统开通后，登录该系统报名，</span></span><span>学院在收到申请后两个工作日内完成审核，对符合条件的申请者发放复试通知。</span></p><p><span><strong>四、注意事项 </strong></span></p><p><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span>、</span><span>申请人必须保证全部申请材料的真实性和准确性，经发现申请人提交的材料内容不真实或不准确，我院将取消拟录取或录取资格</span><span>。</span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span>、</span><span>根据教育部有关接收推免生的时间安排，获得推免资格的学生必须在规定时间内在教育部“推免服务系统”选报学校和专业</span><span>。</span><span>未在规定时间完成网上操作，将视为自动放弃推免资格</span><span>。</span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span>、</span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span>年推免生注册、报名、缴费及拟录取全部在教育部“推免服务系统”进行，拟录取考生不再进行现场确认。</span></p><p><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span>、</span><span>本</span><span>简章</span><span>内容与上级教育主管部门日后下达文件不一致的，以上级教育主管部门下达的最新文件为准</span><span>。</span></p><p><span><strong>五、联系方式</strong></span></p><p><span>联系人：田老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：</span><span><span>027-87889550</span></span></p><p><span>地址：武汉市洪山区武汉理工大学南湖校区</span><span>创业学院</span><span>立行楼4号楼</span><span><span><span>606</span></span></span></p><p><span>邮编：</span><span><span>430070</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>武汉理工大学</span><span>创业学院</span></p><p><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span>年</span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span>月</span><span><span><span>14</span></span></span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>","textSha256":"aa70d70dad6370570f1a06da6b341881510c62a557df810b795e9f1c9553eb95","textLength":1076,"sourceSha256":"cbedc00d97d9e95b875c31daab0f2a048ef764e0f6992e3788e35277ea9d945e","selector":"article-like:list_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-8a8f17dbd2f4cec49b0d","title":"2025年武汉理工大学创业学院2026年推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生招生简章","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:14.032653+00:00"}
